### 3. `.gitignore`
Create a file named `.gitignore` in the root folder to avoid committing unnecessary operating system, editor, or personal files:

```gitignore
# OS generated files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# VS Code directory & state
.vscode/

# Local backup / log files
*.log
*.tmp
